{"id":"msg_m_ex_leona_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_leona","label":"Leona · Nikke"},"label":"3. Zoo Keeper,","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_leona_02","next":null,"speakers":{"leona":"Leona"},"icons":{"leona":"si_c382_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_1","text":"Zoo Keeper,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_2","text":"Timi wants to see you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_3","text":"Can you come to the shelter now?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_4","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_4","text":"I'm a bit busy right now.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_5","text":"You are?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_6","text":"Darn... what should I do?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_7","text":"I don't know when you two got so close, but he keeps asking for you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_8","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_9","text":"How about this?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_10","text":"I'll transcribe for Timi","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_11","text":"and write down what he says here,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_12","text":"then relay your responses back to him.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_13","text":"That way, you two can communicate no problem!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_14","text":"Certainly sounds interesting.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_15","text":"Okay,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_16","text":"wait just a moment.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_17","text":"Hey, this is Timi.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_18","text":"How are you doing?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_19","text":"Is this really Timi?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_20","text":"Yes, it's me! I'm a bit nervous.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_21","text":"Hehe, you should see how anxious he is, Zoo Keeper. It's adorable.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_22","text":"So, why did you want to see me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_23","text":"You're a good human,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_24","text":"and the best person I know, after Leona, of course.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_25","text":"Awww, thanks, Timi! I'm touched.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_26","text":"You're a pretty good lion yourself, Timi.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_27","text":"Thanks!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_28","text":"I'm not sure if you know this,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_29","text":"but lately, all Leona talks about is...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_30","text":"Um...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_31","text":"She talks about you every now and then.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_32","text":"... Did you just change what you were going to say?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_33","text":"No.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_34","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_34","text":"You're not lying to me, are you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_35","text":"No!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_36","text":"It's just that Timi forgot what he was going to say. He's too nervous, hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_37","text":"I've been telling Timi a lot about you, and he just wants to see you, that's all.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_38","text":"Actually,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_39","text":"it's probably for the best that you and Timi can't communicate.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_40","text":"I've got a few things I need to discuss with him,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_41","text":"so I'll be off.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_42","text":"Leona? Timi?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_03_43","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_03_43","text":"There is no reply from Leona.","jump":null}],"chat":true}